-- MAGIC %md-sandbox
-- MAGIC ### B2. Logical Isolation
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC Unity Catalog's comprehensive fine-grained security model alone can provide the logical isolation requirements that most organizations need.
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC The diagram below illustrates this mechanism in action. Despite all catalogs being collocated in the same metastore, we enforce:
-- MAGIC - Members of the _sales_ group can only access sales-related catalogs
-- MAGIC - Members of the _engg_ group can only access engineering-related catalogs
-- MAGIC - Members can only read (access schemas) from their corresponding production catalogs, while they can also write (create schemas) in their corresponding development catalogs
